 Hall","notes":"If you live in Gillet, use the dedicated room when lounge activity is distracting; respect residence access controls and community quiet rules.","short_summary":"Gillet distinguishes focused academic space from its general community lounge.","evidence_claim":"Immaculata’s residential-community page states that Gillet Hall includes both a community lounge and a dedicated study room.","source_url":"https://www.immaculata.edu/campus-life/living-on-campus/residential-communities/","source_title":"Residential Communities - Immaculata University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Gillet Hall is a secured residence hall with ID-swipe access; use is limited to residents and authorized guests.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"iu-gabriele-library-heritage-room","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Heritage Room","title":"Ask for the Campus Story Behind the Campus","subtitle":"Immaculata University Archives on Gabriele Library’s second floor","notes":"Bring a focused research question, visit during posted business hours or arrange an appointment, and ask staff which archival materials fit your topic.","short_summary":"The Heritage Room turns institutional records into a research resource for students and other scholars.","evidence_claim":"Immaculata states that its Archives are in the Heritage Room on Gabriele Library’s second floor and support teaching, research and scholarship.","source_url":"https://www.immaculata.edu/academics/library/archives/","source_title":"Archives - Immaculata University","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Visits may be arranged by appointment or made during business hours; the university says the office is usually open weekdays from 9 a.m. to 2:30 p.